"@value": "(A transit map is a representation of a public transportation network focusing on the connectivity of stations via transit lines, such as railway networks, bus lines, and ferry routes. Among these examples, metro maps, subway maps, or tube maps are typical transit maps of metropolitan railways.)" } ] },  { "@id": "http://id.loc.gov/authorities/genreForms/gf2022026093", "@type": [ "http://www.loc.gov/mads/rdf/v1#GenreForm", "http://www.loc.gov/mads/rdf/v1#Authority" ], "http://www.loc.gov/mads/rdf/v1#authoritativeLabel": [ { "@language": "en",
